{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ajar is a point-and-click escape room, where every puzzle tells a story. Crawling with psychological horror and hand-drawn art, you\u2019ll play as an ill-fated girl haunted by death, determined to find your missing brother - even if it kills you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles Hold The Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle says more than it should. Solve once to escape, solve again to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996360/extras/d51270e2484795445b3b35c5385d6f40.poster.avif?t=1758349612\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996360/extras/d51270e2484795445b3b35c5385d6f40.webm?t=1758349612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996360/extras/d51270e2484795445b3b35c5385d6f40.mp4?t=1758349612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Room, Multiple Outcomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ajar is one escape room. If it seems small, look again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996360/extras/17a1ec8883eb9fcd39eb1eb9eb58595e.poster.avif?t=1758349612\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996360/extras/17a1ec8883eb9fcd39eb1eb9eb58595e.webm?t=1758349612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996360/extras/17a1ec8883eb9fcd39eb1eb9eb58595e.mp4?t=1758349612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-click escape room puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability with multiple outcomes and secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable narrative cutscenes and visual storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-3 hour experience designed to be finished in one sitting or replayed with new eyes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D art shifting between clean and cartoonish to stark and disturbing</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996360?t=1758349612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996360?t=1758349612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996360/f82d12e95e6fd1e5038ed6eaf525d9e524473410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758349612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996360/f82d12e95e6fd1e5038ed6eaf525d9e524473410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758349612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"- Non-graphic but frequent character deaths including actions that may resemble self-harm\r\n- Dark themes involving death, intrusive thoughts, and emotional instability\r\n- Occasional blood and disturbing imagery related to psychological horror\r\n- Infrequent crude language or sexual humor\r\n- Screen shakes, visual distortions, and sudden audio cues\r\n- Story elements involving the misuse of science and medicine\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ajar is a point-and-click escape room, where every puzzle tells a story. Crawling with psychological horror and hand-drawn art, you\u2019ll play as an ill-fated girl haunted by death, determined to find your missin